            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for to demolish, then the Kannada for a statue."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಮುಸ್ಸಂಜೆ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮುಸ್ಸಂಜೆ — mussañje — \"dusk; twilight\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮುಸ್ಸಂಜೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಹಕ್ಕಿಗಳು ಗೂಡಿಗೆ ಹಿಂತಿರುಗುತ್ತವೆ. mussañjeyalli hakkigaḷu gūḍige hintiruguttave. At dusk the birds go back to their nests."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮುನ್, before, and ಸಂಜೆ, evening: the time as evening comes on."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮುಸ್ಸಂಜೆ (mussañje) is a Kannada compound of native mun, \"before\" (DEDR 5020), and ಸಂಜೆ, \"evening\", borrowed from Sanskrit saṃdhyā, \"juncture, twilight\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
