          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮೂಡು (mūḍu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 5035 lists Kannada mūḍu, \"to arise, to originate, to become visible\", and mūḍa, \"the east\"."
