              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): ಗೋಚರಿಸಿತು, gōcarisitu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A bookish verb; in talk people say ಕಾಣಿಸು."
            }
          ]
